  nonce: 20cd  # 20cd
  message: "PR-ready. Fix scope grew from 4 surface sites (decorator_dispatch, enclosure, json_config, base.py emit_module_attribute_refs) to 67 production Edge.create sites across 35 files when the user chose the full structural fix path. Edge.__post_init__ now hard-raises on empty origin/origin_run_id. LEGACY_DESERIALIZED_SENTINEL added so Edge.from_dict survives legacy on-disk JSON. Property test asserts hypergumbo's own self-analysis emits zero edges with empty provenance and zero sentinel-carrying production edges. Awaits bakeoff validation of the quantitative claim: 425+1 edges with empty origin_run_id on 2026-05-16 self-analysis -> 0 post-fix."  # 20cd
