  message: "Fixed in PR #3810 (full structural fix) + PR-pending slim-down of property test. Edge.__post_init__ now hard-raises on empty origin/origin_run_id. Plumbed run_id through 67 production Edge.create sites across 35 files. LEGACY_DESERIALIZED_SENTINEL injected by Edge.from_dict for legacy on-disk JSON survives cache reads. 501 test sites mass-updated to pass provenance kwargs. Property test simplified to construction-time unit tests + static source-scan for sentinel containment (~0.1s vs original 90s self-analysis). Tagged awaits_bakeoff_validation: 425+1 edges with empty origin_run_id on 2026-05-16 self-analysis -> 0 post-fix."  # 4f30
