  message: "Stripping tag under Phase 2 anomaly cleanup (extended sweep). Verdict: D-stale — post-fix dogfood is explicit in the 2026-05-19T03:41:37Z closing entry: '425+1 edges with empty origin_run_id on 2026-05-16 self-analysis -> 0 post-fix.' The fix is also load-time-enforced: 'Edge.__post_init__ now hard-raises on empty origin/origin_run_id' — the construction-time guard means the post-fix count CANNOT regress to anything other than 0 without test-suite failure. Strictly stronger than a cohort measurement."  # 02c3
